        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Norton 7900 Series Concealed Door Closer</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Norton 7900 door closer is a overhead concealed closer specially designed for where a closer is needed but concealment in the frame header is required or desired. It has an adjustable spring size and comes in an Aluminum Finish.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Norton 7900 Door Closer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Back Check</li>\r\n<li>Aluminum Alloy Shell</li>\r\n<li>All Weather Fluid</li>\r\n<li>UL10C Compliant for Positive Pressure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Norton 7900 Series Door Closer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Finish:</b> Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Door Width: 27\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 250 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Spring Size 1-6</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
